    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/0aa04636202047e818356ad66c7b44e6.avif?t=1753887330\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/92f67ca328ca0d378568ea8f008dceb1.avif?t=1753887330\" /></div><br>It's up to you and your team to find the missing research team. You will stumble upon challenges and unimaginable predators. Suit up and choose your gear because you are going to expend every last bullet in order to make it to the end.<br><br>Explore the forest with your team. The smallest detail could be important to your mission.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/8321b359d38a1f98f1d83577f497db32.poster.avif?t=1753887330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/8321b359d38a1f98f1d83577f497db32.webm?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/8321b359d38a1f98f1d83577f497db32.mp4?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully cooperative with up to 4 players</li><li>Single Player Mode</li><li>Horde AI System</li><li>Dynamic Difficulty</li><li>Weapon and Equipment Progression</li></ul><br>Purchase weapons and equipment upgrades to increase your survivability.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/eb0b079f8ccbc20f2c8b1b276dc86abc.poster.avif?t=1753887330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/eb0b079f8ccbc20f2c8b1b276dc86abc.webm?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/eb0b079f8ccbc20f2c8b1b276dc86abc.mp4?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unreal Engine 5</li><li>Open Non-linear World</li><li>Character Customization</li><li>In-game Feedback</li></ul><br>Use your equipment to give yourself the advantage against anything you may encounter.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/cb09dcf51d65d1c17e80c1095a7e5619.poster.avif?t=1753887330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/cb09dcf51d65d1c17e80c1095a7e5619.webm?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/cb09dcf51d65d1c17e80c1095a7e5619.mp4?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/92f67ca328ca0d378568ea8f008dceb1.avif?t=1753887330\" /></div><br>It's up to you and your team to find the missing research team. You will stumble upon challenges and unimaginable predators. Suit up and choose your gear because you are going to expend every last bullet in order to make it to the end.<br><br>Explore the forest with your team. The smallest detail could be important to your mission.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/8321b359d38a1f98f1d83577f497db32.poster.avif?t=1753887330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/8321b359d38a1f98f1d83577f497db32.webm?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/8321b359d38a1f98f1d83577f497db32.mp4?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully cooperative with up to 4 players</li><li>Single Player Mode</li><li>Horde AI System</li><li>Dynamic Difficulty</li><li>Weapon and Equipment Progression</li></ul><br>Purchase weapons and equipment upgrades to increase your survivability.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/eb0b079f8ccbc20f2c8b1b276dc86abc.poster.avif?t=1753887330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/eb0b079f8ccbc20f2c8b1b276dc86abc.webm?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/eb0b079f8ccbc20f2c8b1b276dc86abc.mp4?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unreal Engine 5</li><li>Open Non-linear World</li><li>Character Customization</li><li>In-game Feedback</li></ul><br>Use your equipment to give yourself the advantage against anything you may encounter.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/cb09dcf51d65d1c17e80c1095a7e5619.poster.avif?t=1753887330\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/cb09dcf51d65d1c17e80c1095a7e5619.webm?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1761900/extras/cb09dcf51d65d1c17e80c1095a7e5619.mp4?t=1753887330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
